cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FrustraPy
message: >-
  FrustraPy is an unofficial Python reimplementation of the Protein
  Frustratometer / frustratometeR. If you use it in your research, please
  cite the references listed below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Engelberger
    given-names: Felipe
repository-code: "https://github.com/engelberger/frustrapy"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX   # add the Zenodo concept DOI after the first release
